<title>USA: Doane Products Co Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Doane Products Co Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>JOPLIN, Mo. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months	 Year	 Twelve Months</p>
<p>				 Ended	     Ended	    Ended</p>
<p>			December 31,    December 31,   December 31,</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995     1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales		   $144,751   $111,618 $500,708    $406,336</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold   128,681     96,364  443,578     341,527</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>   administrative	 9,273	7,641   32,219	36,630</p>
<p> Operating income	 6,797	7,613   24,911	28,179</p>
<p> Interest expense	 5,514	5,926   22,687	 9,633</p>
<p>Non-recurring finance</p>
<p>   charge		     ---	  ---    4,815	   ---</p>
<p> Other (income) expense   (2)	 (91)    (218)	 (195)</p>
<p>Income (loss) before</p>
<p>   taxes on income	1,285	1,778  (2,373)	18,741</p>
<p>Taxes (tax benefit)</p>
<p>   on income		  308	  754    (855)	   971</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	  977	1,024  (1,518)	17,770</p>
<p>Note: The 1995 results of operations are comprised of (a) the nine months ended September 30, 1995 of the predecessor company prior to its acquisition in October 1995 by DPC Acquisition Corp., and (b) the three months ended December 31, 1995 subsequent to the acquisition.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Doane Products Co.</p>
<p>(in thousands)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
